    "directions": [
      "Add some water to a large cooking pot, then bring to bowl.",
      "Cut up your chicken into pieces and take skin off and season with salt, pepper, all purpose seasoning and mixed herbs. Then add to your pot.",
      "Add pumpkin or butternut squash and season, salt, pepper, pimento and mix together and cook down for 20 minutes.",
      "Add onions, spring onions, garlic, ginger, carrots, sweet potatoes, yam and corn, cho cho then mix and cook for further 15 mins until tender.",
      "Add dumplings, scotch bonnet and fresh thyme and cook for 15 minutes. Then add cock soup mix and cook for further 5 minutes then simmer and serve."
    ],
